{"hero":"<img class=\"health-opening-image\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/1106ce9687be07986a2c.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"NutriPaw app cover\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">","subtitle":"<h2 class=\"subtitle\">Helping busy pet owners keep track of daily food, treats and activity.</h2>","about":"<div class=\"content-align-right\"><div class=\"copy-block\"><h3 class=\"eyebrow\">about</h3><p class=\"body-copy-large\">NutriPaw is a new mobile app concept for helping busy owners track their pets’ daily care. My contribution covered research, user flows, wireframes and UI prototyping, informed by five research respondents.</p></div></div>","labels":["discovery","prototyping","design system"],"body":"<style>\n.nutri-flow-board{padding:clamp(18px,2.5vw,40px)!important}.nutri-flow-track{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:34px;width:100%;list-style:none;margin:24px 0 0;padding:0;counter-reset:none}.nutri-flow-track>li{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:stretch;min-width:0;margin:0;padding:0}.nutri-flow-node{box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-width:0;width:100%;padding:22px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #b8c9c4;border-radius:10px;color:#004b40;font-family:neue-haas-grotesk-display,sans-serif;line-height:1.35;text-align:center}.nutri-flow-node strong{font-size:clamp(16px,1.25vw,20px);font-weight:700}.nutri-flow-node span{font-size:clamp(14px,1vw,16px);font-weight:400}.nutri-flow-arrow{position:absolute;top:50%;right:-30px;width:26px;height:20px;transform:translateY(-50%);color:#004b40}.nutri-flow-branch-label{margin:24px 0 12px;color:#004b40;font-size:16px;text-align:center}.nutri-flow-branches{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.nutri-flow-branches .nutri-flow-node{background:#d7eae2;border-color:#9bb9ad}\n@media(max-width:767px){.nutri-flow-track{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}.nutri-flow-arrow{top:auto;bottom:-26px;right:calc(50% - 13px);transform:rotate(90deg)}.nutri-flow-node{padding:18px 14px}.nutri-flow-branches{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}}\n</style><style>\n.nutri-section{min-width:0}.nutri-section .health-architecture-intro{align-items:start!important}.nutri-section .health-architecture-intro .copy-block{min-width:0}.nutri-section .health-architecture-intro .health-panel-image{width:100%;height:auto!important;max-height:none!important}\n.nutri-section>.health-panel.nutri-logo{box-sizing:border-box!important;display:flex!important;justify-content:center!important;align-items:center!important;align-self:stretch!important;width:100%!important;max-width:none!important;min-height:clamp(180px,22vw,360px);margin:0!important;padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px)!important;background:#fff;position:relative!important;transform:none!important}.nutri-section>.nutri-logo>.health-panel-image{display:block!important;flex:0 1 1100px;width:100%!important;max-width:1100px!important;min-width:0;height:auto!important;max-height:none!important;margin:auto!important;position:static!important;transform:none!important;object-fit:contain!important;object-position:center!important}\n.nutri-comparison{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px!important;align-items:stretch!important;width:100%;min-width:0}.nutri-comparison-panel{min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:clamp(12px,1.5vw,24px)}.nutri-phone-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(10px,1.5vw,24px);align-items:start;min-width:0;width:100%}.nutri-phone-pair>.nutri-phone{justify-self:center;display:block!important;position:static!important;transform:none!important;width:100%!important;max-width:100%!important;height:auto!important;max-height:none!important;min-width:0;object-fit:contain!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;border-radius:0!important;background:transparent!important}\n.nutri-design-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))!important}.nutri-design-grid>.health-system-column{justify-content:flex-start;gap:16px!important}.nutri-design-grid .health-panel-image{display:block;width:100%;height:auto!important;max-height:none!important;object-fit:contain}.nutri-design-grid .health-panel:has(img[alt=\"Confirmation\"]){max-width:92px}\n.nutri-section>.caption{box-sizing:border-box;width:min(100%,70ch);align-self:flex-end;margin-top:14px}.nutri-section>.caption p{margin:0}\n@media(max-width:767px){.nutri-comparison{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.nutri-design-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.nutri-section>.caption{width:100%}}\n</style><div class=\"content-align-left\"><div class=\"content-section nutri-section\"><figure class=\"health-panel nutri-logo\"><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/7ac8e5ad66f9e53d7e61.webp\" width=\"1170\" height=\"280\" alt=\"NutriPaw logo from Figma\" loading=\"eager\"></figure></div></div><div class=\"content-align-left\"><div class=\"content-section nutri-section\"><div data-wf--section-header--variant=\"horizontal\" class=\"section-copy-wrap\"><h1 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">01</span>discovery</h1><div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Research with five respondents highlighted busy routines and difficulty tracking treats and activity. These findings shaped an app concept that brings daily care into one place.</p></div></div><div class=\"health-architecture-intro\"><figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Stats, food and exercise · App navigation</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/72dc9df114bce4201bdf.webp\" width=\"1741\" height=\"456\" alt=\"Stats, food and exercise · App navigation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"copy-block\"><h2 class=\"subheading\">defining the daily plan</h2><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Owners described difficulty keeping track of treats. This informed a daily stats view with a treat counter, alongside water and exercise tracking, while the daily plan brings care tasks together.</p></div></div><figure class=\"health-panel nutri-flow-board\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">User flow · From onboarding to daily care</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 1030\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"nf-title nf-desc\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"><title id=\"nf-title\">NutriPaw user flow: onboarding and daily care</title><desc id=\"nf-desc\">New users sign up and set up their pets before creating a plan. Returning users log in and reach the homepage. The homepage connects to stats, food, exercise and reminders.</desc><defs><marker id=\"nf-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M600 65V94\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><path d=\"M475 135H245V180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><text x=\"355\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#004b40\">New user</text><path d=\"M725 135H955V180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><text x=\"850\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#004b40\">Returning user</text><path d=\"M245 255V290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><path d=\"M245 355V390\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><path d=\"M245 455V490\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><path d=\"M245 555V590\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><path d=\"M400 625H600V650\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><path d=\"M955 255V625H600V650\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><path d=\"M600 715V742H260V760\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><path d=\"M600 715V760\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><path d=\"M600 715V742H940V760\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"10\" width=\"220\" height=\"55\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"44.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Open NutriPaw</text><path d=\"M600 88L735 135L600 182L465 135Z\" fill=\"#d7eae2\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#004b40\">First visit?</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"180\" width=\"310\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"214.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Sign up</text><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"241.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#34655c\">Email, Google, Facebook or Apple</text><rect x=\"800\" y=\"180\" width=\"310\" height=\"75\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"955.0\" y=\"214.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Log in</text><text x=\"955.0\" y=\"241.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#34655c\">Email, Google, Facebook or Apple</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"290\" width=\"310\" height=\"65\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"329.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Choose number of pets</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"390\" width=\"310\" height=\"65\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"419.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Customise pet profile</text><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"446.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#34655c\">Name, age and photo</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"490\" width=\"310\" height=\"65\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"529.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Create a personalised plan</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"590\" width=\"310\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"245.0\" y=\"632.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Start 7-day trial / app tour</text><rect x=\"465\" y=\"650\" width=\"270\" height=\"65\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"689.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Homepage / daily plan</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"760\" width=\"300\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"792.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Pet stats</text><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"819.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#34655c\">Treats, water and activity</text><rect x=\"450\" y=\"760\" width=\"300\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"802.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Food requirements</text><rect x=\"790\" y=\"760\" width=\"300\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"940.0\" y=\"802.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Exercise</text><path d=\"M940 830V865\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"790\" y=\"865\" width=\"300\" height=\"65\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"940.0\" y=\"894.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Set training reminder</text><text x=\"940.0\" y=\"921.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#34655c\">Choose date and time</text><path d=\"M940 930V960\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34655c\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#nf-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"790\" y=\"960\" width=\"300\" height=\"55\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#9bb9ad\"/><text x=\"940.0\" y=\"994.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#004b40\">Allow notifications</text></svg></figure></div></div><div class=\"content-align-left\"><div class=\"content-section nutri-section\"><div data-wf--section-header--variant=\"horizontal\" class=\"section-copy-wrap\"><h1 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">02</span>prototyping</h1></div><div class=\"health-wireframe-pair nutri-comparison\"><figure class=\"health-panel nutri-comparison-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Low-fi exploration · Pet setup and daily plan</figcaption><div class=\"nutri-phone-pair\"><img class=\"health-panel-image nutri-phone\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/9d16f72350cdaadd11fc.webp\" width=\"1170\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Low-fi pet profile\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img class=\"health-panel-image nutri-phone\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/47971da16b7efc8ee5c1.webp\" width=\"1170\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Low-fi daily plan\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></figure><figure class=\"health-panel nutri-comparison-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">High-fi concept · Pet setup and daily plan</figcaption><div class=\"nutri-phone-pair\"><img class=\"health-panel-image nutri-phone\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/ed270b2df6d9bf76a13d.webp\" width=\"1170\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Final pet profile\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img class=\"health-panel-image nutri-phone\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/292581eaefb50e590e4a.webp\" width=\"390\" height=\"844\" alt=\"Final daily plan\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></figure></div><div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">Low-fi wireframes explored pet setup and the daily task list. High-fi prototyping developed those ideas through progress cues, photography and consistent navigation.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"content-align-left\"><div class=\"content-section nutri-section\"><div data-wf--section-header--variant=\"horizontal\" class=\"section-copy-wrap\"><h1 class=\"display-medium\"><span class=\"display-medium-alt_wrap\">03</span>design system</h1></div><div class=\"content-block health-system-overview\"><div class=\"health-system-grid nutri-design-grid\"><div class=\"health-system-column\"><figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Progress chart states</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/5c9abbf710b201f971a8.webp\" width=\"630\" height=\"435\" alt=\"Progress chart states\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Counter controls</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"181\" height=\"60\" alt=\"Counter controls\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div><div class=\"health-system-column\"><figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Mobile navigation</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/72dc9df114bce4201bdf.webp\" width=\"1741\" height=\"456\" alt=\"Mobile navigation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Active and inactive icons</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"292\" height=\"102\" alt=\"Active and inactive icons\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Confirmation</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\" alt=\"Confirmation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div><div class=\"health-system-column\"><figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Primary and secondary buttons</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"350\" height=\"160\" alt=\"Primary and secondary buttons\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure class=\"health-panel\"><figcaption class=\"health-panel-title\">Pet profile fields</figcaption><img class=\"health-panel-image\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" width=\"336\" height=\"140\" alt=\"Pet profile fields\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div></div><div class=\"caption\"><p class=\"body-copy-small\">A teal and lime identity gives the new app a recognisable visual language. Reusable navigation, fields, counters and progress indicators support consistency across the experience.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"nutri-prototype-recording\" style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:48px auto 72px;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:0 24px\"><div class=\"nutri-video-viewport\" style=\"position:relative;width:min(100%,390px);aspect-ratio:780/1688;overflow:hidden;border-radius:7.7% / 3.56%;border:0;box-shadow:none;isolation:isolate\"><video autoplay muted loop playsinline disablepictureinpicture controlslist=\"nodownload nofullscreen noremoteplayback\" preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"NutriPaw app prototype demonstration\" style=\"display:block;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;max-width:none;height:auto;border:0;box-shadow:none;outline:none;border-radius:0;transform:translateY(-1.0429%);pointer-events:none\" src=\"__PORTFOLIO_MEDIA__/61919b72af2a953358f0.mp4\"></video></div></div>"}